        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Effective June 1, 1999, based on the individual sales goal results for the fiscal quarter beginning March 1, 1999 through May 31, 1999 the commission rate for sales employees under these classifications may be enhanced based on their individual sales goal performance.",
