        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "At the end of each fiscal quarter the Sales Employees actual SVPH will be compared to their individual SVPH goal. SVPH goals will be derived from the zone selling cost goals and the individual's hourly base rate (hourly and buyouts).",
